            <ArticleTitle>Lumbovertebral syndrome after extradural blood patch.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>414-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a patient who developed an immobilizing lumbovertebral syndrome after an extradural blood patch and who was hospitalized with a suspected extradural abscess. An infectious aetiology of the persistent backache could be excluded and the patient recovered with analgesics and physiotherapy. The probable aetiology is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
